From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] olesvr32, olecli32: OLE 1.0 registries and object dispatch (3576)

olesvr32, olecli32: OLE 1.0 libraries with registries and object dispatch

olesvr32: server and document registries (handles, duplicate names, block/unblock,
revoke with OLE_WAIT_FOR_RELEASE and the server's Release callback), OleRevokeObject,
OleQueryServerVersion. olecli32: client document registry, every object function
dispatching through the object vtable (32-bit types, the old header used 16-bit ones),
clipboard queries, stream functions, creation functions answering OLE_ERROR_CLASS /
PROTOCOL / OPEN / LAUNCH (no DDE server protocol). The wrong forwards of OleCreate,
OleCreateFromFile, OleSaveToStream and OleLoadFromStream to the OLE 2 versions are replaced.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
---
